The description of a good fiber wallet could be found at [DIS] Fiber Link: A CKB Fiber-based Pay Layer (Tipping & Micropayments) for Communities - #42 by keith
a wallet with strong Fiber support and good liquidity;
To be more specific, a wallet routed to our recipient node through liquidity fiber nodes, and the liquidity fiber nodes support channel rotation so we can extract funds from channel without disconnection.
